@root = http://localhost:5080

### Application readiness (no search backend required)
GET {{root}}/health

### Sample database
GET {{root}}/meta/databases

### Both sample tables
GET {{root}}/meta/databases/sample/tables

### Two-dimensional metadata
GET {{root}}/meta/databases/sample/tables/flows

### All 24 flow values
GET {{root}}/data/databases/sample/tables/flows?filters=MEASURE:code=*
Accept: application/json

### Filtered data: two years, one measure (100, 110)
POST {{root}}/data/databases/sample/tables/flows
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "TIME": { "type": "first", "query": 2 },
  "MEASURE": { "type": "code", "query": ["IN"] }
}

### CSV export
GET {{root}}/data/databases/sample/tables/flows?filters=TIME:last=2
Accept: text/csv

### Three-dimensional metadata
GET {{root}}/meta/databases/sample/tables/observations

### All 65 observation values (explicitly include every region)
GET {{root}}/data/databases/sample/tables/observations?filters=REGION:code=*
Accept: application/json

### One observation (REGION=B, TIME=2015, MEASURE=COUNT): value 22
POST {{root}}/data/databases/sample/tables/observations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "REGION": { "type": "code", "query": ["B"] },
  "TIME": { "type": "code", "query": ["2015"] },
  "MEASURE": { "type": "code", "query": ["COUNT"] }
}

### Clear sample database caches
DELETE {{root}}/cache/databases/sample
